    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Dec 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿拉丁（音乐剧演员）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> “音乐剧小学生”阿拉丁的上课日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 怎样的一部戏让他获得“飞速”成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> 先给自己定一个一年的小目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 提前点播之《大彗星》选段演唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> 现场解答：为什么新疆人都能歌善舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 少年时期就尝试过很多舞台，主动才有机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 动漫迷现场安利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> 多才多艺的阿拉丁为你读诗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> 是什么样的“多面体”让现场大喊“神奇”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> 让新疆人夸赞好吃的上海饭店</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音频放送】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 儿时演唱曲目大回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a> 节目舞台经典唱段今日重唱</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别提醒：请提前调节音量哦</span></p>]]></description>
