  <item>
    <title>【剧星对谈】邵立君、施博威：19年我忙着高考，他的男团刚刚解散</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657c75733d5d24e9cb366537</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657c75733d5d24e9cb366537</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Dec 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邵立君（音乐剧演员）</span></p><span></span><p><span>施博威（音乐剧演员）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 签到了自己的cp超话？我真的是手滑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 施博威开启音乐剧之旅的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 面对新的关系我们是如何破冰的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 同年“我”在高考，他的男团刚刚解散</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 听i人邵立君讲讲他的“支点”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> “大摄影家”施博威：设备一般，纯属审美比较好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 现场提问环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 我们如此多才多艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2609">43:29</a> 如何看待新业态与新尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">47:38</a> 时间管理大师的自我修养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3214">53:34</a> 来听正主亲自解释“汤姆和杰瑞”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【下期活动预告】</span></p><span></span><p><span>出席卡司：阿拉丁·阿斯哈力</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间：12月17日（周日） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>地点：魔剧会客厅（襄阳大楼）</span></p>]]></description>
