  <item>
    <title>【音乐剧·女神在看】“羊蝎子”的气泡音&amp;“岩闪电”的大眼睛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6565828f0500be931c23b1bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6565828f0500be931c23b1bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Nov 2023 06:02:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘岩（演员，在音乐剧《女神在看》中饰演“闪电”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>遇泓羊（演员，在音乐剧《女神在看》中饰演“蝎子”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> 有希望所以有勇气，“闪电”在无人岛上的成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> 细节决定胜负，希望六个角色能给观众带来多样化的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> “蝎子”是一个行动派，排练这部剧对体能是一项考验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 台下的刘岩就是现实版的“闪电”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 不断挑战新角色会让人感到过瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 听听刘岩眼中的“羊蝎子”是怎样的形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 遇泓羊：听着岩哥的原声带长大的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 观众具有包容性，但最终还是会回归到剧本本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a> 冥想放空过后能让自己的精神更加集中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> “模范演员”刘岩的自律生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 多尝试不同的戏剧类型，对自身能力的提高和事物的认知都会有所帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剧讯】</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐剧《女神在看》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023.12.01-12.17</span></p><span></span><p><span>人民大舞台（九江路663号）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljuTxv87CZxtN1WEZ2uQB8dnThHr.png"></figure>]]></description>
