  <item>
    <title>【话剧·两只狗的生活意见】上海场演出特别企划——刘晓晔的“即兴”线下分享会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653dcf3a0255cd89fd3b4ba9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653dcf3a0255cd89fd3b4ba9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Oct 2023 03:19:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘晓晔（教师、演员，代表作品《两只狗的生活意见》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 《两只狗》的诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 我的两只狗“赵阳”与“旺财”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 十年之久，无法忽视的年龄增长与阅历变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 所有的即兴都是台下无数次排演的成果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 曾经我有个名字叫“刘云晓”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> 现场花活整起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">36:37</a> 相比看书，更乐于“听”书 历史题材深受刘晓晔的喜爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> 上海给自己的感觉很舒服，偶尔也会来段city walk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> “导”与“演”的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> 现场重现刘晓晔教学课堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 从不同的门类中汲取养分，戏剧与建筑学也息息相关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 女儿见我第一句话“呦 熟人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3985">1:06:25</a> 年纪小+没经验，多方压力让自己刚上大学就有退学的冲动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4316">1:11:56</a> 喜剧的内核是悲剧，但刘晓晔并不是一个悲观的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剧讯】</span></p><span></span><p><span>话剧《两只狗的生活意见》</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海 10.29 上海大剧院-别克中剧场</span></p><span></span><p><span>廊坊 11.04-11.05 丝绸之路国际艺术交流中心-歌剧厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>杭州 11.16-11.19 杭州蜂巢剧场</span></p><span></span><p><span>厦门 11.30-12.01 厦门嘉庚剧院</span></p><span></span><p><span>福州 12.02-12.03 福州大学城文化艺术中心</span></p><span></span><p><span>北京 12.12-12.17 蜂巢剧场</span></p><span></span><p><span>武汉 12.31-01.01 武汉剧院</span></p><span></span><p><span>郑州 02.23-02.24 郑州大剧院</span></p>]]></description>
