    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpbkhzLWhlekhhOG15eUVjUVhtN0VaaS1nbEUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【剧星对谈】刘迦：在每一个人生的重要关头，尽力而为，不留遗憾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651cdbb950cf691d240dc666</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651cdbb950cf691d240dc666</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Oct 2023 03:27:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘迦（青年舞蹈家、演员）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 从舞剧演员到话剧演员的身份转变对刘迦来说是最大的一项挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 表演节奏与观众的反馈相互影响，演员的情感是自然流露</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 从舞蹈演员的视角来看，人物的肢体表达会有哪些不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 刘迦的军旅生活与艺术学习的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 团队作战要学会取舍与退让</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2882">48:02</a> 影视表演、话剧表演是一项全新的挑战，更是获得成长的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a> 让人生充满惊喜与挑战，听从自己内心的声音</span></p>]]></description>
